// src/pages/commercial/dishwasher-repair/glass-washer-repair.astro
// Phase B-1 — sub-service under commercial dishwasher pillar.
// Architecture: bar-specific, lower temp 130-140°F (preserves etched glassware),
// 60-90 second cycles. Hoshizaki HG, CMA Glass Mizer, Champion CG.
